{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The subject property is not located within convenient walking distance of town centre facilities. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 2 - The original property is less than 130 square metres in area and therefore fails to meet the minimum size threshold to be considered suitable for conversion. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 3 - The applicant has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in increased disturbance to residents of neighbouring properties contrary to Local Plan polices CC2 and SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposal would fail to provide adequate waste and recycling facilities, contrary to Local Plan policies SC10 and EQ7 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD and the Recycling and Refuse Guidance."
  ],
